## User

Reverse a list.

## Type

type
```haskell
myReverse :: [a] -> [a]
```

## Term

```haskell
myReverse [] = []
myReverse (x:xs) = myReverse xs ++ [x]
```

## ghc

```haskell
myReverse = myReverse . reverse
```

